Title: The Regular
Credit: The M4 sample short (W12)
Set: cafe.vrmxs
Cast:
    HANA = hana-1
    MIRA = mira
Marks:
    HANA = behind-counter
    MIRA = counter-front

INT. CAFE - MORNING

Rain on the front window. Hana is alone behind the counter when Mira hurries up to it, shaking the rain from her sleeves.

HANA
(smiling)
Morning, Mira! [[greet]] The usual?

MIRA
(laughs)
Am I that easy to read?

HANA
An oat latte, extra hot, and you'll pretend you don't want the last croissant.

MIRA
[[point]] I don't want the last croissant.

HANA
(beat)
I saved it [[happy]] for you anyway.

Hana turns to the espresso machine. Steam hisses. [[MIRA look: HANA]]

MIRA
(to Hana)
I have news, actually. I got the job.

HANA
The one at the studio? [[surprised]] Mira, that's wonderful!

MIRA
(nods)
I start on Monday. It's across town.

HANA
(pause)
So, [[sad]] no more mornings here, then.

MIRA
(warmly)
Are you kidding? I'll be in every weekend. [[cheer]]

HANA
Then the croissant is on the house. [[laugh]]

At the window table, Mira wraps both hands around her cup. [[MIRA at: window-table]] [[MIRA relaxed]]

MIRA
(to Hana)
Still the best latte in the city. [[sip]]

HANA
(grins)
Tell your new office that. [[nod]]

The rain eases off outside. Hana smiles to herself and goes back to wiping the counter. [[HANA happy]]

FADE OUT.
